Package: MitoBEAP
Type: Package
Title: Mitochondrial Base Editor Analysis Package (MitoBEAP)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Lindsey", "Van Haute",
      email = "lvh27@cam.ac.uk",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: MitoBEAP is an R package designed to analyze mitochondrial base editing data from 
	DdCBE experiments. It calculates both on-target and off-target editing efficiencies, 
	visualizes editing patterns, and produces reports for submission to data repositories.
